  "stem": "If \\(7 - 2(x - 4) = 3x\\), what is the value of \\(x\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "3"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Distribute: \\(7 - 2x + 8 = 3x\\), so \\(15 - 2x = 3x\\).",
    "Add \\(2x\\) to both sides: \\(15 = 5x\\).",
    "So \\(x = 3\\)."
  ],
